# Screenshots и отладка

## TakesScreenshot

```java
// Скриншот всей страницы
File screenshot = ((TakesScreenshot) driver).getScreenshotAs(OutputType.FILE);
Files.copy(screenshot.toPath(), Paths.get("screenshot.png"));

// Скриншот конкретного элемента
File screenshot = ((TakesScreenshot) driver).getScreenshotAs(OutputType.FILE);
BufferedImage full = ImageIO.read(screenshot);
Rectangle rect = element.getLocation().getSize();
BufferedImage crop = full.getRect(rect);
ImageIO.write(crop, "png", new File("element.png"));
```

## Скриншот на падение теста

```java
@AfterEach
void takeScreenshotOnFailure(AssertionError error) {
    if (error != null) {
        try {
            File src = ((TakesScreenshot) driver).getScreenshotAs(OutputType.FILE);
            Files.copy(src.toPath(), Paths.get("screenshots/failure.png"));
        } catch (IOException e) {
            // ignore
        }
    }
}
```

## Allure attachments

```java
@Attachment(value = "Screenshot on failure")
public byte[] screenshotAsBytes() {
    return ((TakesScreenshot) driver)
        .getScreenshotAs(OutputType.BYTES);
}
```

## К практике

### takeScreenshot
Сделай скриншот и верни base64-строку.

```java
File screenshot = ((TakesScreenshot) driver).getScreenshotAs(OutputType.FILE);
byte[] bytes = Files.readAllBytes(screenshot.toPath());
return Base64.getEncoder().encodeToString(bytes);
```

